  "body": "[vca~] is a stereo (two in/out) VCA. It is the basis of the [vca2.m~] MERDA module. For convenience, it sums polyphonic (multichannel connections) inputs into a single channel by default. You also have a general gain compensation and outputs to feed [vu] objects."
